  "notes": [
    "Packet 21 adds the non-prefab M2 content/property command fixtures. The packet-16 accepted fixtures under fixtures/m2/contracts/commands/ are unchanged and are also replayed by packages/commands/src/m2-content.test.ts (the byte-exact M1 publishBehavior and M2 setBehaviorProperties pairs, plus the base/r3/r4 atomic-rejection cases).",
    "content-ops.messages.json is a declarative scenario: `base.state` (relative to fixtures/m2/) is the packet-16 released-state before envelope at revision 2, and the demo-0003 manifest is the one in contracts/commands/queries.json. Each `out` is the exact pure-layer payload (success \u00a75.1 or failure \u00a75.2) produced by applying the request to the state accumulated by the preceding steps; the vitest suite asserts them byte-for-byte.",
    "Prefab operations (createPrefab/instantiatePrefab) and queryPrefabs are packet 22 and are deliberately absent from this index. No workspace executor exists here: publishAsset carries prepared, digest-addressed facts only and never reads a file or stage.",
    "S8 (no-change component write), S9 (unknown settings key) and S10 (stale revision reported before argument validation) are failures and consume no revision.",
    "Packet 27 repair (C27-1/C28-1) adds commands/model-authoring.messages.json: byte-exact request/result pairs for createEntity kind=model (whole-GLB placement), undo/redo of the create, asset_reference_missing, and collider/controller add/edit/remove (including component_conflict and collider_shape_invalid-class rejection). Replayed byte-for-byte by packages/commands tests."
